    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Ernie Mihaly Ernest Mihaly was born in 1920 on East 122nd Street in the Buckeye Road neighborhood where he still lives. He was baptized at the First Hungarian Lutheran Church. He grew up in this same Hungarian neighborhood and attended Hungarian Language classes. His schools included Harvey Rice, Audubon Jr. He played the violin through his junior year in high school in the school Orchestra."
    ]
  },
